<title>HONG KONG: CITIC shares gain on HK Tel stake sale.</title>
<headline>CITIC shares gain on HK Tel stake sale.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>CITIC Pacific Ltd shares edged up HK$0.30 to HK$43.80 when trading resumed after a half-day suspension pending an announcement the company had sold 7.74 percent of Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd to China Everbright Holdings Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
